OL,3,GNEWSADevelopment bid for 335 homes
OL,4,Arejected after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 335 homes on the outskirts of
OL,7,FOswestry have been rejected by
OL,8,FShropshire Council.
OL,10,FWain Estates had been seeking outline
OL,11,Fplanning permission to build on land
OL,12,Fsouth of Mount Road, but the
OL,13,Fapplication drew more than 300
OL,14,Fobjections from people in the area.
OL,16,FIn coming to its decision, the council
OL,17,Fsaid it had concerns about access to
OL,18,Fthe planned housing estate, about
OL,19,Fflooding and about its impact on local
OL,20,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
