OL,3,GNEWSADevelopment bid for 335 homes
OL,4,Arejected after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWendy Owen, one of the councillors
OL,7,Frepresenting the town, said she was
OL,8,F"delighted" with the outcome and
OL,9,Fthanked "the passion of the many
OL,10,Fresidents who often raised the issues
OL,11,Fwith highway access and flooding".
